{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "drh5k0tbr82364vg", "title": "2.LangChain提示词工程应用实践", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ubf17a415\" id=\"ubf17a415\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159935566-0d91ab94-ecfb-48c0-a3a9-6ed4e790df18.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22langchain-prompt.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A12244%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u229ec6ac-3829-4ed8-9a1e-1042c0f7e9e%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22transfer%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u387bbdac%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"k944B\" id=\"k944B\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6e52b46\" id=\"uc6e52b46\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Prompt templates（提示词模板）</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf0978009\" id=\"uf0978009\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c5160de\" id=\"u1c5160de\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">语言模型以文本作为输入 - 这个文本通常被称为提示词(prompt)。在开发过程中，对于提示词通常不能直接硬编码，不利于提示词管理，而是通过提示词模板进行维护，类似开发过程中遇到的短信模板、邮件模板等等。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a75c9f7\" id=\"u3a75c9f7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fwebp%2F2424104%2F1736078650772-49cc2215-9944-4363-a515-661f8aac7b5b.webp%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2169c444-ef38-4e0c-b5f7-18a0e7ca31f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub5086980-a25d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A667.6923321831165%2C%22height%22%3A256%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2264b8936c0bccdc569ca15c504a302d55_u%3D1578766093%2C829081525%26fm%3D253%26fmt%3Dauto%26app%3D120%26f%3DJPEG_w%3D1302%26h%3D500.webp%22%2C%22size%22%3A109753%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1302%2C%22originHeight%22%3A500%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.9499999284744263%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOESXLIKETY%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODELL%2FO%22%2C%22x%22%3A94%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3D%5C%22FOO%5C%22%2CY%3D%5C%22BAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A127%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREDICT%22%2C%22x%22%3A720%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORMAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASON'%3ABECAUSE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1049%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LIKES%3ATRUE%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1049%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOESFOOLIKEBAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDWHY%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A129%2C%22y%22%3A385%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1085%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDWHY%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A386%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FOODOES...%22%2C%22x%22%3A834%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A664%2C%22y%22%3A373%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A663%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A671%2C%22y%22%3A349%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e6f9ec%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud2e9ba7c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wp38D\" id=\"wp38D\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20a2f15d\" id=\"u20a2f15d\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">什么是提示词模板？</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u040a76b9\" id=\"u040a76b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1aa5a76\" id=\"ud1aa5a76\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">提示词模板本质上跟平时大家使用的邮件模板、短信模板没什么区别，就是一个字符串模板，模板可以包含一组模板参数，通过模板参数值可以替换模板对应的参数。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud4d8ab55\" id=\"ud4d8ab55\"><span data-lake-id=\"u866da52c\" id=\"u866da52c\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">一个提示词模板可以包含下面内容：</span></p><ul list=\"ue6f6c42b\"><li fid=\"u9ae98e7f\" data-lake-id=\"ud644ed84\" id=\"ud644ed84\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2af1bfd\" id=\"ua2af1bfd\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">发给大语言模型（LLM）的指令。</span></li><li fid=\"u9ae98e7f\" data-lake-id=\"ud06877f2\" id=\"ud06877f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u177a3e28\" id=\"u177a3e28\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">一组问答示例，以提醒AI以什么格式返回请求。</span></li><li fid=\"u9ae98e7f\" data-lake-id=\"u36848418\" id=\"u36848418\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12a6be2f\" id=\"u12a6be2f\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">发给语言模型的问题。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"C8CY0\" id=\"C8CY0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc262d2c\" id=\"ufc262d2c\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">创建一个提示词模板(prompt template)</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u7c75c710\" id=\"u7c75c710\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6346906e\" id=\"u6346906e\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua8a54a37\" id=\"ua8a54a37\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d4febef\" id=\"u4d4febef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c1edebf\" id=\"u1c1edebf\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">PromptTemplate</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufa5f9993\" id=\"ufa5f9993\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucda87153\" id=\"ucda87153\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">类创建简单的提示词。提示词模板可以内嵌任意数量的模板参数，然后通过参数值格式化模板内容。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain.prompts%20import%20PromptTemplate%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%ABadjective%E5%92%8Ccontent%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%7B%7D%E5%8C%85%E6%8B%AC%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%5Cnprompt_template%20%3D%20PromptTemplate.from_template(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%E7%BB%99%E6%88%91%E8%AE%B2%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%7Bcontent%7D%E7%9A%84%7Badjective%7D%E7%AC%91%E8%AF%9D%E3%80%82%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%5Cnresult%20%3D%20prompt_template.format(adjective%3D%5C%22%E5%86%B7%5C%22%2C%20content%3D%5C%22%E7%8C%B4%E5%AD%90%5C%22)%5Cnprint(result)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZmSHf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucb480cfc\" id=\"ucb480cfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uadc5a06a\" id=\"uadc5a06a\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">模板输出结果：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22vbnet%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%BB%99%E6%88%91%E8%AE%B2%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E7%8C%B4%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B7%E7%AC%91%E8%AF%9D%E3%80%82%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aQHZg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Wd7RH\" id=\"Wd7RH\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24df97db\" id=\"u24df97db\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">聊天消息提示词模板(chat prompt template)</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub9b9169c\" id=\"ub9b9169c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue42d7d06\" id=\"ue42d7d06\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">聊天模型（Chat Model）以聊天消息列表作为输入，这个聊天消息列表的消息内容也可以通过提示词模板进行管理。这些聊天消息与原始字符串不同，因为每个消息都与“角色(role)”相关联。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubdcd90f0\" id=\"ubdcd90f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa4f8bb1\" id=\"uaa4f8bb1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">例如，在OpenAI的</span><a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/text-generation/chat-completions-api\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ueee0a0c8\" id=\"ueee0a0c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1624a52b\" id=\"u1624a52b\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Chat Completion API</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6ce0fbd4\" id=\"u6ce0fbd4\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">中，Openai的聊天模型，给不同的聊天消息定义了三种角色类型分别是助手(assistant)、人类（human）或系统（system）角色：</span></p><ul list=\"uf14e376f\"><li fid=\"u66205e88\" data-lake-id=\"ubab94ecd\" id=\"ubab94ecd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85e96ccc\" id=\"u85e96ccc\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">助手(Assistant) 消息指的是当前消息是AI回答的内容</span></li><li fid=\"u66205e88\" data-lake-id=\"u650d6cdf\" id=\"u650d6cdf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u668e7499\" id=\"u668e7499\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">人类（user）消息指的是你发给AI的内容</span></li><li fid=\"u66205e88\" data-lake-id=\"u5f5debb9\" id=\"u5f5debb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua76c515c\" id=\"ua76c515c\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">系统（system）消息通常是用来给AI身份进行描述。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u996d3aa9\" id=\"u996d3aa9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16baf698\" id=\"u16baf698\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">创建聊天消息模板例子</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain_core.prompts%20import%20ChatPromptTemplate%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%81%8A%E5%A4%A9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%5Cn%23%20%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%85%83%E7%BB%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%88%E4%B9%9F%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E3%80%82%5Cn%23%20%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%9Asystem%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E3%80%81human%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8Cai%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8LLM%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cn%23%20%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%862%E4%B8%AA%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0name%E5%92%8Cuser_input%5Cnchat_template%20%3D%20ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20(%5C%22system%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%E6%98%AF%7Bname%7D%E3%80%82%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20(%5C%22human%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20(%5C%22ai%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%E6%88%91%E5%BE%88%E5%A5%BD%EF%BC%8C%E8%B0%A2%E8%B0%A2%EF%BC%81%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20(%5C%22human%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%7Buser_input%7D%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%5Cnmessages%20%3D%20chat_template.format_messages(name%3D%5C%22Bob%5C%22%2C%20user_input%3D%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%E5%8F%AB%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%EF%BC%9F%5C%22)%5Cnprint(messages)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h2K2O%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u184ed5b6\" id=\"u184ed5b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf964325\" id=\"ubf964325\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">另外一种消息格式例子：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain.prompts%20import%20HumanMessagePromptTemplate%5Cnfrom%20langchain_core.messages%20import%20SystemMessage%5Cnfrom%20langchain_core.prompts%20import%20ChatPromptTemplate%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8langchain%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84SystemMessage%E3%80%81HumanMessagePromptTemplate%E7%AD%89%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E8%B7%9F%E5%89%8D%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%BE%8B%E5%AD%90%E7%B1%BB%E4%BC%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%A4%E6%9D%A1%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%5Cnchat_template%20%3D%20ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20SystemMessage(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20content%3D(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%B9%90%E4%BA%8E%E5%8A%A9%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%B6%A6%E8%89%B2%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E5%85%B6%E7%9C%8B%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E6%9B%B4%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%98%93%E8%AF%BB%E3%80%82%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20HumanMessagePromptTemplate.from_template(%5C%22%7Btext%7D%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E5%8C%96%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%5Cnmessages%20%3D%20chat_template.format_messages(text%3D%5C%22%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8D%E5%96%9C%E6%AC%A2%E5%90%83%E5%A5%BD%E5%90%83%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%5C%22)%5Cnprint(messages)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sexQb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u20251325\" id=\"u20251325\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2616e37\" id=\"uc2616e37\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">通常我们不会直接使用format_messages函数格式化提示模板(prompt templae)内容, 而是交给Langchain框架自动处理。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uad080cfe\" id=\"uad080cfe\"><span data-lake-id=\"uadd481cf\" id=\"uadd481cf\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"pfZYc\" id=\"pfZYc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2bafc9b2\" id=\"u2bafc9b2\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\">MessagesPlaceholder</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u26765edf\" id=\"u26765edf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06c3833d\" id=\"u06c3833d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\">这个提示模板负责在特定位置添加消息列表。 在上面的 ChatPromptTemplate 中，我们看到了如何格式化两条消息，每条消息都是一个字符串。 但是，如果我们希望用户传入一个消息列表，我们将其插入到特定位置，该怎么办？ 这就是您使用 MessagesPlaceholder 的方式。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain_core.prompts%20import%20ChatPromptTemplate%2C%20MessagesPlaceholder%5Cnfrom%20langchain_core.messages%20import%20HumanMessage%5Cnprompt_template%20%3D%20ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages(%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20(%5C%22system%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20MessagesPlaceholder(%5C%22msgs%5C%22)%5Cn%5D)%5Cnprompt_template.invoke(%7B%5C%22msgs%5C%22%3A%20%5BHumanMessage(content%3D%5C%22hi!%5C%22)%5D%7D)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SUFtL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc542fd89\" id=\"uc542fd89\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c9e3cad\" id=\"u8c9e3cad\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\">这将生成两条消息，第一条是系统消息，第二条是我们传入的 HumanMessage。 如果我们传入了 5 条消息，那么总共会生成 6 条消息（系统消息加上传入的 5 条消息）。 这对于将一系列消息插入到特定位置非常有用。 另一种实现相同效果的替代方法是，不直接使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3797d485\" id=\"u3797d485\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub51b9331\" id=\"ub51b9331\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4aa9268\" id=\"ue4aa9268\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\">MessagesPlaceholder</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u664c86d7\" id=\"u664c86d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ubfc5d19a\" id=\"ubfc5d19a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33)\">类，而是：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22prompt_template%20%3D%20ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages(%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20(%5C%22system%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant%5C%22)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20(%5C%22placeholder%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%7Bmsgs%7D%5C%22)%20%23%20%3C--%20%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%5Cn%5D)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cgAOv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udc041d15\" id=\"udc041d15\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0ebf2830\" id=\"u0ebf2830\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46f3ad26\" id=\"u46f3ad26\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"提示模板\" id=\"提示模板\"><br></h3><h1 data-lake-id=\"h1--few-shot-prompt-templates-\" id=\"h1--few-shot-prompt-templates-\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4dc23d9\" id=\"ub4dc23d9\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">提示词追加示例(Few-shot prompt templates)</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5963b6f5\" id=\"u5963b6f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7adfe7c7\" id=\"u7adfe7c7\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">提示词中包含交互样本的作用是为了帮助模型更好地理解用户的意图，从而更好地回答问题或执行任务。小样本提示模板是指使用一组少量的示例来指导模型处理新的输入。这些示例可以用来训练模型，以便模型可以更好地理解和回答类似的问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u03e2728e\" id=\"u03e2728e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0cd95b7\" id=\"ud0cd95b7\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">例子：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q%3A%20%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AF%E8%9D%99%E8%9D%A0%E4%BE%A0%EF%BC%9F%5CnA%3A%20%E8%9D%99%E8%9D%A0%E4%BE%A0%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%99%9A%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E3%80%82%5Cn%5CnQ%3A%20%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AFtorsalplexity%EF%BC%9F%5CnA%3A%20%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5%E3%80%82%5Cn%5CnQ%3A%20%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9F%5CnA%3A%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ng49B%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua163221b\" id=\"ua163221b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e4d3c9c\" id=\"u9e4d3c9c\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">告诉模型根据，Q是问题，A是答案，按这种格式进行问答交互。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufe4c7368\" id=\"ufe4c7368\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0731e11e\" id=\"u0731e11e\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">下面讲解的就是Lanchain针对在提示词中插入少量交互样本提供的工具类。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"h2-u4F7Fu7528u793Au4F8Bu96C6\" id=\"h2-u4F7Fu7528u793Au4F8Bu96C6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57724403\" id=\"u57724403\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">使用示例集</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"h3-u521Bu5EFAu793Au4F8Bu96C6\" id=\"h3-u521Bu5EFAu793Au4F8Bu96C6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua971983b\" id=\"ua971983b\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">创建示例集</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u38dd3a75\" id=\"u38dd3a75\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8d825298\" id=\"u8d825298\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">下面定义一个examples示例数组，里面包含一组问答样例。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langchain.prompts.few_shot%20import%20FewShotPromptTemplate%5Cnfrom%20langchain.prompts.prompt%20import%20PromptTemplate%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnexamples%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22question%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E8%B0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%BF%E5%91%BD%E6%9B%B4%E9%95%BF%EF%BC%8C%E7%A9%86%E7%BD%95%E9%BB%98%E5%BE%B7%C2%B7%E9%98%BF